{"seq":1,"slug":"linkage-confidence-evidence-tier","title":"关联证据强度分级与误判控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-evidence-adjudication/linkage-confidence-evidence-tier","wordCount":2132,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"关联证据强度分级与误判控制\">关联证据强度分级与误判控制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前两章产出了带分数的关联簇，但从分数到「该不该处置」之间还有一道鸿沟：分数是模型输出的连续量，处置是二元且不可逆的动作。本节建立证据分级体系，把连续分数映射到离散的证据等级，并定义每一级对应的误判控制手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据的四个等级\">证据的四个等级</h2><p>证据分级的目的不是精确，而是<strong>可沟通</strong>——让复核人员、申诉审核者、以及卖家本人都能理解「系统掌握的是哪一档证据」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四级划分表\">四级划分表</h3><p>四级划分在实践中被证明足够：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型信号</th>\n<th>误判概率量级</th>\n<th>允许的处置上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 确证</td>\n<td>官方登记或资金实体的直接同源</td>\n<td>同一统一社会信用代码、同一支付账户主体</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>关联封禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 强证</td>\n<td>多个独立强信号或强信号 + 弱信号</td>\n<td>UBO 同源 + 设备共现</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>合并主体、强制分账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 推论</td>\n<td>多路弱信号同向共现且无合法解释</td>\n<td>设备 + 收款 + 退货地址 + 电话</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>限流、警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4 线索</td>\n<td>单路或少量弱信号</td>\n<td>仅 IP 共现</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>仅记录、进入监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>等级之间不是连续滑动的，而是<strong>有明确门槛的不连续跳变</strong>。这一点很关键：如果允许分数平滑映射到处罚力度，那么模型的微小抖动就会造成处置的剧烈变化，申诉时会无法解释「为什么昨天没事今天被封」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"等级判定的决策流程\">等级判定的决策流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;关联簇分数&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;是否存在 L1 信号?&quot;}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[&quot;L1 确证&quot;]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; D{&quot;强信号数 &gt;= 1&lt;br/&gt;且总分 &gt;= T2?&quot;}&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; E[&quot;L2 强证&quot;]&#10;  D -- 否 --&gt; F{&quot;弱边数 &gt;= 3&lt;br/&gt;且总分 &gt;= T3?&quot;}&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;L3 推论&quot;]&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; H[&quot;L4 线索&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; I[&quot;按等级取处置上限&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[\"关联簇分数\"] --&gt; B{\"是否存在 L1 信号?\"}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[\"L1 确证\"]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; D{\"强信号数 &gt;= 1&lt;br/&gt;且总分 &gt;= T2?\"}\n  D -- 是 --&gt; E[\"L2 强证\"]\n  D -- 否 --&gt; F{\"弱边数 &gt;= 3&lt;br/&gt;且总分 &gt;= T3?\"}\n  F -- 是 --&gt; G[\"L3 推论\"]\n  F -- 否 --&gt; H[\"L4 线索\"]\n  C --&gt; I[\"按等级取处置上限\"]\n  E --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"弱信号共现的联合概率计算\">弱信号共现的联合概率计算</h2><p>L3 推论的门槛「多路弱信号同向共现」需要一个量化判据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"独立信号的联合概率\">独立信号的联合概率</h3><p>核心问题是：<strong>在无关卖家中，恰好同时命中这几路信号的概率是多少？</strong></p>\n<p>设信号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_1, \\dots, s_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相互独立（需要时按相关性折减），则在「不同卖家」假设下的联合概率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>all</mtext><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{all} \\mid H_0) = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 路信号在总体中的基线频率。举例：若同一支付账户的基线频率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同一设备指纹为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4 \\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，同一退货地址为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.1 \\times 10^{-2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则三路同现的巧合概率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8.8 \\times 10^{-11}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">11</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这个数量级看似「必然确证」，但它有陷阱：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计依赖总体定义，而总体本身会因为平台业务特征而严重偏离。共享同一物流仓地址的基线频率在「跨境电商 + 海外仓」场景下远高于综合平台。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按业务分区维护基线\">按业务分区维护基线</h3><p>因此<strong>基线必须按业务分区估计</strong>，而不是全平台一个数。下面给出分区基线的维护与查询方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 信号基线表: 按业务分区维护, 定期重算&#10;CREATE TABLE signal_baseline (&#10;  signal_type    TEXT NOT NULL,      -- same_device_fp | same_payout | ...&#10;  segment        TEXT NOT NULL,      -- 业务分区: 类目+履约模式+地区&#10;  base_rate      NUMERIC NOT NULL,   -- 该分区内的巧合频率&#10;  sample_size    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  computed_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (signal_type, segment)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 计算某簇的巧合概率与证据等级&#10;WITH cluster_signals AS (&#10;  SELECT c.cluster_id, e.signal_type, COUNT(*) AS hits&#10;  FROM linkage_cluster c&#10;  JOIN cluster_edge e USING (cluster_id)&#10;  WHERE e.is_strong = false&#10;  GROUP BY c.cluster_id, e.signal_type&#10;),&#10;scored AS (&#10;  SELECT cs.cluster_id,&#10;         EXP(SUM(LN(b.base_rate))) AS coincidence_prob,&#10;         SUM(cs.hits) AS weak_hits&#10;  FROM cluster_signals cs&#10;  JOIN signal_baseline b&#10;    ON b.signal_type = cs.signal_type&#10;   AND b.segment = &#39;electronics|overseas_warehouse|eu&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY cs.cluster_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT cluster_id, coincidence_prob, weak_hits,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN coincidence_prob &lt; 1e-9 AND weak_hits &gt;= 3 THEN &#39;L3&#39;&#10;         WHEN coincidence_prob &lt; 1e-6 AND weak_hits &gt;= 2 THEN &#39;L4&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;L4&#39;&#10;       END AS evidence_tier&#10;FROM scored&#10;WHERE coincidence_prob &lt; 1e-4;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 信号基线表: 按业务分区维护, 定期重算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> signal_baseline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signal_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- same_device_fp | same_payout | ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  segment        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 业务分区: 类目+履约模式+地区</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base_rate      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该分区内的巧合频率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_size    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (signal_type, segment)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计算某簇的巧合概率与证据等级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_signals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cluster_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signal_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> linkage_cluster c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_edge e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cluster_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">is_strong</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cluster_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signal_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cluster_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         EXP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(LN(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_rate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coincidence_prob,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weak_hits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_signals cs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signal_baseline b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signal_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">signal_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">segment</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'electronics|overseas_warehouse|eu'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cluster_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cluster_id, coincidence_prob, weak_hits,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coincidence_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 1e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weak_hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coincidence_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 1e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weak_hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'L4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evidence_tier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coincidence_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 1e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>EXP(SUM(LN(...)))</code> 是概率连乘的 SQL 惯用写法，避免了嵌套乘法。同时注意这个查询只处理弱信号——强信号的存在与否由上游的等级判定先一步裁决（L1/L2 判定不走这条路径）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误判的两个来源与对策\">误判的两个来源与对策</h2><p>误判不是单一现象，它有截然不同的两个来源，对策也完全不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"假阳性-冤枉合规卖家\">假阳性：冤枉合规卖家</h3><p><strong>假阳性（冤枉合规卖家）</strong> 来自真实但无害的共现。典型场景：同一产业园区的多家独立卖家共用同一仓库服务商、同一代运营公司为竞品店铺操作、家族成员各自独立经营但共用客服团队。控制手段有三层——<strong>排除已知共享设施</strong>（把第三方物流仓、代运营服务商、共享办公 IP 段维护成白名单，命中即降权到零）、<strong>要求多路信号独立性</strong>（至少两路不同源的信号才计入 L3）、<strong>人工复核门槛</strong>（L3 及以上处置必须有人工确认，见下节）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"假阴性-漏放逃逸卖家\">假阴性：漏放逃逸卖家</h3><p><strong>假阴性（漏放逃逸卖家）</strong> 来自卖家的主动对抗：一店一设备一 IP、拆分收款、外包客服，使所有信号都被切断。控制手段是<strong>降低对单类信号的依赖</strong>、<strong>引入难以伪造的信号</strong>（资金链路的最终受益人、供应链上游重合、物流面单的发件人信息）、以及<strong>接受一定漏放率换取低误伤</strong>。这是一个明确的取舍：在关联治理中，误伤的成本显著高于漏放，因为误伤会带来申诉、监管风险与卖家流失，而漏放只是延迟发现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误判类型</th>\n<th>成因</th>\n<th>主要对策</th>\n<th>度量指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>假阳性</td>\n<td>共享设施/代运营/家族经营</td>\n<td>共享设施白名单 + 多信号独立性 + 人工复核</td>\n<td>申诉推翻率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假阴性</td>\n<td>卖家主动隔离信号</td>\n<td>引入资金与供应链信号 + 接受漏放</td>\n<td>复发率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可解释性与自动化决策的边界\">可解释性与自动化决策的边界</h2><p>误判控制的最后一个支柱是<strong>可解释性</strong>，它同时也是监管要求。欧盟《通用数据保护条例》第 22 条规定，数据主体有权不受「仅基于自动化处理（包括画像）且对其产生法律效力或类似显著影响」的决定的约束，除非该决定为履行合同所必需、由法律授权、或基于明确同意；在合同必需与同意两种情形下，控制者必须提供至少包括「获得控制者方面的人工干预」的保障，数据主体有权「表达其观点并对决定提出异议」（来源：<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-22-gdpr/\">GDPR Art. 22</a>）。</p>\n<p>平台对商家店铺的限制是否落入第 22 条的范围需要逐案判断（涉及合同关系与法律依据的具体分析），但工程上的稳健做法是<strong>无论是否落入，都按最高解释性标准设计</strong>：任何 L2 以上的处置都必须能输出结构化的理由，且该理由必须可被人工审核者独立验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision_id&quot;: &quot;DEC-2026-0912-00441&quot;,&#10;  &quot;cluster_id&quot;: &quot;clu_a91f3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidence_tier&quot;: &quot;L2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;decided_by&quot;: &quot;policy_engine_v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;human_reviewed&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;reviewer_role&quot;: &quot;seller_risk_analyst&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reason_codes&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;same_ubo_chain&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 10.8, &quot;refs&quot;: [&quot;ent_8821&quot;, &quot;person_h_7c1&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;same_payout_account&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 10.2, &quot;refs&quot;: [&quot;acct_3391&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;code&quot;: &quot;same_device_fp&quot;, &quot;weight&quot;: 6.4, &quot;refs&quot;: [&quot;fp_0a9d&quot;] }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;evidence_path&quot;: [&quot;S-10021&quot;, &quot;acct_3391&quot;, &quot;S-10087&quot;],&#10;  &quot;explanation_text_ref&quot;: &quot;msg_tpl_l2_shared_account&quot;,&#10;  &quot;appeal_deadline&quot;: &quot;2026-10-12T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reversible&quot;: true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DEC-2026-0912-00441\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cluster_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clu_a91f3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decided_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"policy_engine_v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"human_reviewed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reviewer_role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller_risk_analyst\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reason_codes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_ubo_chain\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"refs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ent_8821\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"person_h_7c1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_payout_account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"refs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acct_3391\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_device_fp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"weight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"refs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fp_0a9d\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S-10021\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acct_3391\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S-10087\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"explanation_text_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"msg_tpl_l2_shared_account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"appeal_deadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-12T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reversible\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份决策记录里有三个字段是误判控制的关键：<code>reason_codes</code> 与 <code>evidence_path</code> 让卖家能理解并针对性举证；<code>human_reviewed</code> 保证 L2 以上不纯靠机器；<code>reversible</code> 与 <code>appeal_deadline</code> 保证决定可被推翻。缺少任何一个，误伤都无法被有效纠正，规则也无法迭代改进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值校准的持续机制\">阈值校准的持续机制</h2><p>证据等级的阈值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）不能一次设定后固定，必须持续校准，因为信号分布会随卖家对抗手段演化而漂移。校准的基准数据是<strong>申诉结果</strong>——被推翻的处置说明阈值过松，被证实但反复漏放的说明过严。</p>\n<p>理想的校准流程是：定期抽取被处置的簇做人工标注（确认真关联/误判），计算各等级下的实际精确率，再调整阈值使 L2 的实际精确率达到预设目标（例如 98%），L3 达到较低目标（例如 85%，因为 L3 只触发轻处置）。这个流程的度量口径与 <a href=\"../linkage-lifecycle-integration/linkage-governance-falsepositive-metric\">关联治理覆盖率/误伤/复发度量</a> 共享，后者提供校准所需的指标计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>证据分四级：L1 确证、L2 强证、L3 推论、L4 线索；等级是不连续的门槛而非连续映射，避免模型抖动导致处置剧烈变化。</li>\n<li>L3 的门槛用弱信号共现的联合巧合概率量化，概率是各信号基线频率的连乘。</li>\n<li>基线频率必须按业务分区维护，跨境外仓等场景的共享设施基线远高于综合平台的默认值。</li>\n<li>误判有假阳性与假阴性两个来源，前者靠共享设施白名单、多信号独立性与人工复核控制，后者靠引入资金与供应链信号并接受一定漏放。</li>\n<li>GDPR 第 22 条对纯自动化决策设定了人工干预与异议权要求，工程上应按最高解释性标准设计，即使逐案判断可能不落入其范围。</li>\n<li>决策记录必须携带 reason_codes、evidence_path、human_reviewed 与 reversible 字段，才具备可申诉与可迭代的基础。</li>\n<li>阈值需用申诉结果持续校准，各级别按不同的精确率目标设定。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关阅读：等级如何映射到动作见<a href=\"linked-store-enforcement-ladder\">关联处置梯度</a>，申诉数据如何回流见<a href=\"seller-appeal-evidence-process\">卖家申诉、举证与解关联复议</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关联证据强度分级与误判控制","id":"关联证据强度分级与误判控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"证据的四个等级","id":"证据的四个等级"},{"level":3,"text":"四级划分表","id":"四级划分表"},{"level":3,"text":"等级判定的决策流程","id":"等级判定的决策流程"},{"level":2,"text":"弱信号共现的联合概率计算","id":"弱信号共现的联合概率计算"},{"level":3,"text":"独立信号的联合概率","id":"独立信号的联合概率"},{"level":3,"text":"按业务分区维护基线","id":"按业务分区维护基线"},{"level":2,"text":"误判的两个来源与对策","id":"误判的两个来源与对策"},{"level":3,"text":"假阳性：冤枉合规卖家","id":"假阳性-冤枉合规卖家"},{"level":3,"text":"假阴性：漏放逃逸卖家","id":"假阴性-漏放逃逸卖家"},{"level":2,"text":"可解释性与自动化决策的边界","id":"可解释性与自动化决策的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值校准的持续机制","id":"阈值校准的持续机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"经营画像相似与关联图谱社区发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-signal-graph/operation-pattern-graph-cluster"},"next":{"title":"关联处置梯度：警告/限流/合并/封禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/seller-multistore-account-linkage-governance/linkage-evidence-adjudication/linked-store-enforcement-ladder"}}